  "details": "A component that works like a contact sender/receiver, but when it collides with a grabbable physbone, it grabs it.\n\nThe \"grab\" could be by default off, and require it to be enabled with an animation\n\nI think it could have different friction settings for how strong the grab is\n\nA few different use cases for this could be:\n\n- Avatar's mouth can bite and pull onto things\n\n- Avatar props like claw grabber toys\n\n- Making the surface of a collider \"sticky\"",
